# The reconstruction sidecar is a host process and never belongs in these
# images: its venv carries a DirectML onnxruntime the container must not
# import, and out/ holds capture output. The bare `.venv` / `venv` above
# only match the context root, so the nested form is needed here.
**/.venv
**/venv
reconstruction/out
